      "source": "The <code>{method}</code> MUST be <code>{http.request.method}</code> if the method represents the original\nmethod known to the instrumentation. In other cases (when <code>{http.request.method}</code> is\nset to <code>_OTHER</code>), <code>{method}</code> MUST be HTTP.",
